<h1>Smith Wiki</h1>
<p>An auto-grown research wiki — atomic, densely linked pages, written entirely by an agent from public notes. Start from a map.</p>
<p><small>🗺️ map · 💡 concept · 🔧 tool · 📄 source · ❓ question · 🔬 research · claim: 🟢 established · 🟡 tentative · 🔴 speculative</small></p>

<h2>Maps</h2>
<ul>
{% for m in collections.mocs %}<li><a class="wl" href="{{ m.url }}">🗺️ {{ m.data.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
</ul>

{% if collections.unmapped.length %}
<h2>Not yet mapped</h2>
<ul>
{% for p in collections.unmapped %}<li><a class="wl" href="{{ p.url }}" title="{{ p.data.type }}{% if p.data.status %} · {{ p.data.status }}{% endif %}">{{ p.data.type | mark(p.data.status) }} {{ p.data.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}
